ard project in the UK typically costs ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"£750–£5,000"}]," for SMEs, depending on complexity. Hourly rates for freelance consultants run ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"£60–£150/hour"}],". At Lexalytic, we charge a fixed price starting from ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"£750"}]," — you know the total cost before we start."]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"17px","color":"var(--ink-2)","lineHeight":"1.85","marginBottom":"32px"},"children":"Most articles about Power BI consulting costs are written by large agencies quoting enterprise numbers, or by overseas firms converting US dollars to pounds. Neither is useful if you run a UK business with a sensible budget and a real problem to solve."}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"17px","color":"var(--ink-2)","lineHeight":"1.85","marginBottom":"48px"},"children":"This guide gives you honest UK market pricing for 2026, the factors that actually drive cost up or down, and how to figure out what your specific project is likely to cost before you speak to anyone."}],["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 1.9rem)","marginBottom":"20px","letterSpacing":"-0.02em"},"children":"UK Power BI consultant pricing in 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"17px","color":"var(--ink-2)","lineHeight":"1.85","marginBottom":"28px"},"children":"There are three main ways UK Power BI consultants charge for their work — and the pricing model matters as much as the headline rate."}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"marginBottom":"48px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","borderRadius":"var(--radius-lg)","overflow":"hidden"},"children":[["$","div","0",{"style":{"display":"grid","gridTemplateColumns":"1fr 1fr 1fr 2fr","gap":"0","borderBottom":"1px solid var(--border)","background":"var(--bg)"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"padding":"16px 20px","fontSize":"14px","fontWeight":"500","color":"var(--ink)"},"children":"Hourly rate"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"padding":"16px 20px","fon