"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"15px","color":"var(--ink-3)","lineHeight":"1.7","margin":0},"children":"Scope creep is the biggest budget killer. If you start with \"a few charts\" and expand to a full reporting suite mid-project, costs rise accordingly. Coming in with a clear list of what decisions you need to make saves significant time."}]]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"style":{"display":"flex","gap":"16px","marginBottom":"20px","alignItems":"flex-start"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"width":"8px","height":"8px","borderRadius":"50%","background":"var(--amber)","marginTop":"8px","flexShrink":0}}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","fontWeight":"500","color":"var(--ink)","marginBottom":"6px"},"children":"Non-standard data sources"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"15px","color":"var(--ink-3)","lineHeight":"1.7","margin":0},"children":"Power BI connects natively to hundreds of systems. If your data lives somewhere without a built-in connector — a custom internal system, for example — building the connection takes extra time."}]]}]]}],["$","div","3",{"style":{"display":"flex","gap":"16px","marginBottom":"20px","alignItems":"flex-start"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"width":"8px","height":"8px","borderRadius":"50%","background":"var(--amber)","marginTop":"8px","flexShrink":0}}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","fontWeight":"500","color":"var(--ink)","marginBottom":"6px"},"children":"Power BI licence requirements"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"15px","color":"var(--ink-3)","lineHeight":"1.7","margin":0},"children":"The dashboard build is separate from licensing. To share reports across your organisation, you'll need Power BI Pro (around £8.40/user/month from Microsoft). This isn't a consultant cost, but it's part of the total investment."}]]}]]}],["$","div","4",{"style":{"display":"flex","gap":"16px","marginBottom":"20px","alignItems":"flex-start"},"children":[["$","d